@gateway = http://localhost:8080/api

### Vehicle catalogue
GET {{gateway}}/vehicules

### Available vehicles for a future period
GET {{gateway}}/vehicules/disponibles?dateDebut=2026-12-01&dateFin=2026-12-04

### Create a vehicle
POST {{gateway}}/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "456TU7890",
  "marque": "Kia",
  "modele": "Rio",
  "categorie": "COMPACTE",
  "annee": 2022,
  "couleur": "Red",
  "carburant": "ESSENCE",
  "boite": "MANUELLE",
  "nbPlaces": 5,
  "kilometrage": 30000,
  "prixJournalier": 88.5,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Search clients
GET {{gateway}}/clients?nom=Amira

### Check eligibility (client 1 is a demonstration client)
GET {{gateway}}/clients/1/eligibilite

### Simulate price: client 1, vehicle 1, three days
POST {{gateway}}/locations/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "vehiculeId": 1,
  "dateDebut": "2026-12-01",
  "dateFinPrevue": "2026-12-04"
}

### Reserve after checking the simulation
POST {{gateway}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "vehiculeId": 1,
  "dateDebut": "2026-12-01",
  "dateFinPrevue": "2026-12-04"
}

### Start a rental (replace 1 with the reservation ID)
PATCH {{gateway}}/locations/1/depart
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kmDepart": 20000 }

### Return a rental (replace 1 with the rental ID)
PATCH {{gateway}}/locations/1/retour
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kmRetour": 20450 }

### Statistics
GET {{gateway}}/locations/statistiques
